Your crystal ball method, for "(" (tools, ie. the Bell and the PYEC) or
"+" (that papyrus spellbook), sounds like a good plan.  Or even potion
of object detection / spell of detect treasure, though those run the
risk of the important items being hidden by other things on top of them.

A common place to lose the book is in the water just outside the tower,
if you killed him there.  If you kill him over water and the Invocation
artifacts or the "oY fall in, then freezing the water causes them to
appear on top of the ice, so you don't need to go swimming/digging to
retrieve them.

Which version are you playing?  A bug through which monsters could level
teleport into the sanctum, before the Invocation was performed, was
fixed in 3.4.2.

